{"type":"text","timestamp":1788702977379,"sessionID":"ses_f88ff2508ffep24o385g8uzP9K","part":{"id":"prt_077014f90001WmDbjS8Xp264YF","messageID":"msg_07700dbbe002uHI5XAyf2Gq3UO","sessionID":"ses_f88ff2508ffep24o385g8uzP9K","type":"text","text":"I have read all three reference works and their planning documents. Let me synthesize a plan for the 기획서 before writing.\n\n**Fusion Strategy:**\n- Main skeleton: 《독식하는 재벌 3세》 — regression, chaebol family, initial capital, future knowledge\n- Financial event investing: 《금수저 투자백서》 — lottery, currency crisis, real-asset accumulation\n- Structural intuition: 《연봉 1조 신입사원》 — ability to read structural flaws in organizations/people as a complement to future knowledge\n\n**Core HOW refined:** Future knowledge (what will happen) + 구조 감지 능력 (where the flaws/value are hidden) → Together these convert overlooked assets and people into self-interest.\n\n**Title:** 《독식하는 정보》 (Monopolizing Information)\n\nBefore I write the full 9-section 기획서, a few questions:\n\n1. **Title flexibility** — Is 《독식하는 정보》 acceptable, or do you prefer I generate alternatives?\n2. **Starting age** — 17 (matching the original) or a different age?\n3. **Industry scope** — Should the financial events follow Korean economic history (IMF, etc.) closely like the originals, or is a slightly different timeline acceptable?\n4. **Depth of distant arcs** — For the 3rd-4th intervals (후반/결말), should I write concrete hypothesis events or leave them as \"미정\" with only direction?\n\nOnce you confirm (or adjust), I will write the full 9-section 기획서 in Korean Markdown.","time":{"start":1788702969744,"end":1788702977359}}}
